 fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\nAdds a `Thread.finished` signal so a function can wait for a thread to finish.\r\n\r\nThe intended usecase is in a script like this, with a thread completing work in the background. After the thread has finished, it sends a signal to the main thread, which can then rejoin the thread without hanging the main loop.\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\nvar thread = Thread.new()\r\n\r\nfunc _ready():\r\n\tthread.start(func(): OS.delay_msec(1000))\r\n\tprint(\"Thread started!\")\r\n\t\r\n\tawait thread.finished\r\n\t\r\n\tprint(\"Thread finished!\")\r\n\tthread.wait_to_finish()\r\n```","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien